      mainEntity: [
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          name: "Why do professionals charge so much for epoxy garage floors?",
          acceptedAnswer: {
            "@type": "Answer",
            text: "Professional garage floor coating prices reflect labor-intensive surface preparation (diamond grinding, degreasing, crack repair), commercial-grade materials not available at hardware stores, liability and warranty, specialized equipment costs, and typically a multi-coat system using higher-grade coatings than consumer kits. The labor alone on a two-car garage runs 10-16 man-hours once surface preparation is included.",
